    This friendly message is coming from:
    <ul>
        <li>Your controller at <code>C:/WEB2026/PHP/Symfony/Symfony-7.4-LTS-Classe2/src/Controller/PublicController.php</code></li>
        <li>Your template at <code>C:/WEB2026/PHP/Symfony/Symfony-7.4-LTS-Classe2/templates/public/index.html.twig</code></li>
    </ul>
</div>
{% endblock %}
